<title>ITALY: Italian bourse closed Tuesday, reopens Friday.</title>
<headline>Italian bourse closed Tuesday, reopens Friday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Milan stock exchange remained closed on Tuesday and will reopen on Friday after the Christmas break.</p>
<p>On Monday, the all-share Mibtel index closed up 0.25 percent at 10,487 and the Mib30 blue chip index ended 0.2 percent higher at 15,672.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
